                        "eng": "Pro Debut!",
                        "jpn": "プロデビュー！"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Sakura gets the okay to start her training at Berserk and her coach Ryo puts her through her paces. Four months later, following the Hell of a Hundred Throws test, she is deemed ready for her debut match, but finally getting in the pro ring makes her realize how serious the sport is.",
