                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Sakura gets a tip from Misaki that her lack of a special move might be holding her back, but it seems she'll have little time to sort that out as her rematch with Kazama is lined up. Meanwhile, Elena and Sakura have a heart-to-heart that motivates them both.",
